              "key": "owner",
              "label": "Data owner",
              "units": 0.7
            }
          ],
          "rows": 6
        },
        {
          "key": "data_integrity_checks",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Data completeness and traceability checks",
          "items": [
            "Each issued batch record matches the current approved master instruction",
            "Unique batch identity is applied to every linked page and record",
            "Materials and equipment are traceable to significant production steps",
            "Dates, times, actual values, performers, and verifiers are contemporaneous",
            "Calculations, units, conversions, and corrections remain reviewable",
            "Samples and test results identify batch, step, time, and disposition",
            "Deviations and interruptions retain original evidence and investigation links",
            "Stage yields and final quantities reconcile to material usage and losses",
            "Packaging and label accountability is complete",
            "Open actions are visible to production and quality reviewers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "data_limitations",
          "type": "textarea",
          "label": "Missing data, sampling assumptions, system limitations, and effect on conclusions",
          "fields": [
